    <string name="probe_defaults_notice">The switches below are only the defaults used when you add a provider. Each provider keeps its own copy afterwards, because every gateway is different — some forbid automated checks in their terms, some rate-limit after three requests. Changing a default here does not touch providers you already have.</string>
    <string name="probe_defaults_goto_manage">Review them provider by provider</string>
    <string name="probe_auto_when_summary">Automatic runs never spend credit: reachability, key validity and balance only. Anything that needs a real call is left for you to tap.</string>

